  "body": "Sitting proudly in the heart of Castor Bay Beach, this exceptional residence offers a rare opportunity to secure an exclusive slice of coastal living within one of Auckland’s most tightly held beachfront enclaves. Wide water views to Rangitoto Island and securely positioned with private road access, the home combines prestige, privacy, and convenience in one distinguished address.\r\n\r\nThe property is thoughtfully designed to deliver both refined luxury and effortless functionality. Three spacious bedrooms including an extra large master bedroom with attached office and large walk-in wardrobe provide comfort, privacy, and flexibility, complemented by three superbly appointed bathrooms — including a standout designer ensuite that elevates everyday living. On the lower level, there is another living room that could easily be utilized as a 4th bedroom with easy external access\r\n\r\nAt the centre of the home, a newly upgraded designer German-made Hacker kitchen features appliances of Gaggenau, Neff and a Zenith multi-function tap, seamlessly combining style and practical convenience. Elegant parquetry flooring flows throughout, adding warmth and timeless sophistication while creating seamless flow for relaxed family living and sophisticated entertaining alike. A dedicated study offers the perfect executive work-from-home environment or quiet homework retreat.\r\n\r\nNatural light pours in from the east, north, and west, ensuring all-day sun and a warm, uplifting ambience throughout the year. Two gas fireplaces are ready for the winter months. A large living area with a gas fire offers ample space for the whole family and guests to relax and enjoy. Outdoors, the easy-care, secure grounds located close to a park you don't need to mow enhance the lock-and-leave appeal while maintaining a sense of privacy and containment rarely found so close to the shoreline.\r\n\r\nOversized internal-access garaging offers practicality and scale, complete with a rear exit door. This valuable feature allows for drive-through convenience and added flexibility for storage, recreational gear, or additional access.\r\n\r\nMoments from Castor Bay’s boutique café and just minutes to Campbells Bay and Milford, the location balances tranquillity with convenience. Excellent motorway connections and zoning for highly regarded schools further enhance the home’s long-term desirability, appealing equally to families, professionals, and returning expats seeking a premier North Shore address.\r\n\r\nSitting proudly and secure on a private road with easy beach access to the boat ramp at the end of the driveway, this rare and beautifully appointed coastal retreat offers sophisticated beachside living contained, curated, and simply exceptional, with every detail designed for luxury, lifestyle, and functionality.\r\n\r\nContact Malcolm Low from New Zealand Sotheby's International Realty for more information.",
